Subject: [PATCH] Timings stay off once worlds tick on their own threads

Audit 2026-11-06 F8, and the recheck's probes as regression tests.

diff --git a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/server/AthenaWorldThread.java b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/server/AthenaWorldThread.java
index 056316c28b83c9213978b7e4c44228e3a49eee6b..e7ca197111126fe51e1ae1a4dfa678469bb2fae6 100644
--- a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/server/AthenaWorldThread.java
+++ b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/server/AthenaWorldThread.java
@@ -101,6 +101,7 @@ public final class AthenaWorldThread extends Thread {
             co.aikar.timings.SpigotTimings.stopServer();
             LOGGER.info("Timings turned off: worlds on their own threads cannot be timed");
         }
+        co.aikar.timings.Timings.athenaKeepDisabled(); // and neither /timings on nor a plugin turns them back on
     }
 
     /** Set once the thread has stopped and its leftover tasks went to the server thread. */
diff --git a/src/test/java/net/minecraft/server/AthenaWorldThreadRecheckTest.java b/src/test/java/net/minecraft/server/AthenaWorldThreadRecheckTest.java
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..aafd94c0643bc624f182341ffa32bb321a95bcaf
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/test/java/net/minecraft/server/AthenaWorldThreadRecheckTest.java
@@ -0,0 +1,355 @@
